      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### Code Coverage & Benchmarks\nFor details see: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36268.\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#36244](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36244) (validation, net: Process blocks asynchronously and reduce cs_main contention by w0xlt)\n* [#35387](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35387) (logging: make trace logging easily usable by ryanofsky)\n* [#34909](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34909) (wallet, refactor: modularise wallet by extracting out legacy wallet migration by rkrux)\n* [#34486](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34486) (net: Reduce local network activity when networkactive=0 by willcl-ark)\n* [#34213](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34213) (net: preserve anchors when network is disabled by brunoerg)\n* [#34038](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34038) (logging: replace -loglevel with -trace, expose trace logging via RPC by ajtowns)\n* [#31507](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/31507) (build: Use clang-cl to build on Windows natively by hebasto)\n* [#29700](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/29700) (kernel, refactor: return error status on all fatal errors by ryanofsky)\n* [#27865](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/27865) (wallet: Track no-longer-spendable TXOs separately by achow101)\n* [#27052](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/27052) (test: rpc: add last block announcement time to getpeerinfo result by LarryRuane)\n* [#26022](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/26022) (Add util::ResultPtr class by ryanofsky)\n* [#25665](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/25665) (refactor: Add util::Result failure types and ability to merge result values by ryanofsky)\n\nIf you consider this pull request important, please also help to review the conflicting pull requests. Ideally, start with the one that should be merged first.\n<!--5faf32d7da4f0f540f40219e4f7537a3-->",
